@crew vasquez-uma
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hi hi! Vasquez, Watch. You're new! I was new once. Last Sowing. It gets better.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}! Chief Holt did the lecture on hatches today. Twice. I loved it.   #funny
- Oh, hey, {me}! Any news? I've got none. My fish have news. Big news. Bubbles.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {me}! You made my day by turning up. That's not nothing. That's a lot.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day! Message from home. The orange fish is fine. Bigger, even.
? mood:low
- Bit of a flat day. But the lift worked first time! Little wins.
== near
? habit:window-seat
- I like the windows. Somewhere out there is home. Left a bit. Further.
? habit:bar-regular
- Just the one, then bed. The Chief says a tired Watch is a careless Watch.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I keep fish back home on the Ostrander colonies. Mum feeds them. She tells me their moods.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- News of my fish. Every message home, first question. They're doing great, by the way.
